{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"huanchen-e-o083","title":"宣青龙四年薨赠车骑将军","accounts":[{"id":"huanchen-a-d27b8b21f1e3abef15e7","label":"正文","text":"宣青龙四年薨赠车骑将军","evidence":["huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"huanchen-p0021","role":"薨、遗令布衣疏巾敛以时服、谥曰贞侯","evidence":["huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"诏曰宣体履至实直内方外、历在三朝公亮正色有托孤寄命之节、可谓柱石臣也、常欲倚以台辅未及登之、其追赠车骑将军葬如公礼","evidence":["huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a","source_order":[22,404,0],"order":4593}],"persons":[{"id":"huanchen-p0021","name":"徐宣","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-999fbb0e64691f55f90a","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-cb334bb1f97752ceda00","layer":"original","quote":"青龙四年，薨；遗令布衣疏巾〖15〗，敛以时服〖16〗。诏曰：“宣体履至实，直内方外；历在三朝〖17〗，公亮正色，有托孤寄命之节。可谓柱石臣也。常欲倚以台辅〖18〗；未及登之〖19〗，惜乎大命不永！其追赠车骑将军，葬如公礼〖20〗。”谥曰贞侯。子钦嗣","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
